# Junbi — Base Conventions

**App:** Junbi — AI kitchen assistant. This repo is `gook-frontend` (React Native + Expo mobile app).

## Naming

- Components: PascalCase (`PriorityCard`, `PantryGrid`)
- Files: kebab-case (`priority-card.tsx`, `pantry-grid.tsx`)
- Hooks: camelCase with `use` prefix (`usePantryItems`)
- TypeScript types: PascalCase (`PantryItem`, `Recipe`)
- API JSON keys: camelCase — DB columns: snake_case (mapped in backend route handlers)

## TypeScript

- Strict mode always. Never use `any`.
- Domain types in `types/index.ts`. Component prop interfaces defined inline.

## Package Manager

- `npm` with `--legacy-peer-deps`

## Commit Format

```
feat: add pantry bulk import
fix: flash list scroll jank on kitchen tab
chore: update dependencies
```
Types: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`

## Error Handling

- Catch at the store action level, surface via UI state (loading / error flags in Zustand)
- Never console.log and ignore errors

## No Comments on What the Code Does

Only add comments for non-obvious WHY (workarounds, constraints, subtle invariants).
